igtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","review_id":"-MjoNII5oP7L2qhhz83kiw","date":"2016-03-28T18:07:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9287298917770386,"text_excerpt":"This place is all organic all the time. It has an antiseptic appearance from the street and from inside, apparently it will help one feel clean and/or seek to feel cleaner. This is a good marketing strategy to appeal to the mental aspect of the physical needs of juice cleanses. However, for those already in love with juice, no marketing necessary. You walk in, you see the juices, you read the ingredients, you notice the attention to date pressed, you appreciate the multiple juice and smoothie options and you limit yourself to what can be reasonably consumed before expiration and/or before breaking the proverbial bank. With that said, yes, for the juice novitiate, the prices seem high. How..."},{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","review_id":"pH2a5oC_F9CaXkU7WCWQzg","date":"2015-12-15T15:26:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9253182411193848,"text_excerpt":"I go here several times a week- it is addictive (in a good way). The carrot and coco, deep roots, Thai greens, greens with lemon, and firecracker are my favorites. The staff is so friendly and uplifting - makes me feel empowered when I visit. 10 dollars is a lot but you really won't find a juice place as good in the city. If you want more energy and a lil glow- go here."},{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","review_id":"-xXZ-G0nW0scjxu2s-VWpQ","date":"2015-08-03T12:55:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9234580993652344,"text_excerpt":"I'm not big on juicing but this place has become one of my favorites to pop in once or twice a week. I love their raw shots and bullet proof coffee blends. I'm a huge Dave Asprey fan and Raw Republic is the only one who carries his products in the state. I swear by his products as they keep me going through my 60+ hour work week. Their staff is always super sweet and knowledgeable."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","photo_id":"FN7z6a5Elkclz_J27JYIXg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/FN7z6a5Elkclz_J27JYIXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9179821014404297},{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","photo_id":"KPh-RKAbQ-L2jFmcH1Y46w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KPh-RKAbQ-L2jFmcH1Y46w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.85145103931427},{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","photo_id":"YBwZjJSv1PyfcC8K0fcUMA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YBwZjJSv1PyfcC8K0fcUMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8115450143814087},{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","photo_id":"k1MXUTSXP3PJV8t4EsIx4w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/k1MXUTSXP3PJV8t4EsIx4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8065083622932434},{"business_id":"j_wOxQrfgJKQdL4G5u8_1A","photo_id":"q6-Xs80MzVBFQZAfRYTOTg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/q6-Xs80MzVBFQZAfRYTOTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7153939008712769}]},"notebook_case":null}
